---

<BaseLayoutEn
  title={`Alignment of postgraduate research topics | ${siteEn.shortName}`}
  description="Alignment of postgraduate dissertation topics with the research activities and publications of their supervisors at the S.P. Timoshenko Institute of Mechanics of the NAS of Ukraine."
  activePage="education"
>
  <main class="postgraduate-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
      <a href={withBase('/en/postgraduate/')}>Postgraduate studies</a>
      <span>›</span>
      <span>Research topics</span>
    </nav>

    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">PhD training quality</p>
      <h1>Alignment of dissertation topics with supervisors’ research activities</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        The page follows the structure of the original table: postgraduate student and years of study,
        dissertation topic, research supervisor with position, and publications confirming the correspondence
        between the topic and the supervisor’s research profile.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-block">
      <div class="section-heading compact-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Summary table</p>
          <h2>Dissertation topics and supervisors’ publications</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Publications are provided as evidence of the correspondence between each dissertation topic and the supervisor’s research profile.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="table-panel">
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Postgraduate student, years of study</th>
                <th>Dissertation topic 2025</th>
                <th>Research supervisor, position 2025</th>
                <th>Supervisor’s publications</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {topicGroups.map((group) => (
                <>
                  <tr class="year-row"><td colspan="4">{group.year}</td></tr>
                  {group.rows.map((row) => (
                    <tr>
                      <td><strong>{row.student}</strong><span>{row.studyYears}</span></td>
                      <td>{row.topic}</td>
                      <td>{row.supervisor}</td>
                      <td>
                        <ol class="publication-list">
                          {row.publications.map(([label, href]) => (
                            <li>{href ? <a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{label}</a> : <span>{label}</span>}</li>
                          ))}
                        </ol>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-block note-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Note</p>
      <h2>Supervisor publications</h2>
      <p>
        The table includes selected publications of research supervisors corresponding to postgraduate dissertation topics.
        If needed, this block can be expanded with complete personal publication lists or kept as a compact confirmation for accreditation materials.
      </p>
      <div class="links-row">
        <a href={withBase('/en/postgraduate/students/')}>Students →</a>
        <a href={withBase('/en/postgraduate/supervisors/')}>Supervisors →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayoutEn>

<style>
  .postgraduate-page { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 46px 20px 72px; }
  .breadcrumbs { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 22px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 750; }
  .page-hero, .table-panel, .note-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .page-hero { padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px); }
  .page-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(2.05rem, 4.5vw, 4.1rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
  .lead { max-width: 940px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .section-block { margin-top: 34px; }
  .table-panel { overflow: hidden; }
  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; min-width: 1180px; border-collapse: collapse; }
  th, td { padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; text-align: left; }
  th { background: var(--accent-dark); color: #fff; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  td { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }
  td:first-child { color: var(--text); min-width: 170px; }
  td:first-child span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--accent-dark); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 850; }
  .year-row td { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent-dark); font-weight: 900; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .publication-list { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  .publication-list li { margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .publication-list span { color: var(--muted); }
  .note-card { padding: 26px; }
  .note-card h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .note-card p { max-width: 920px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .links-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .links-row a { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent-dark); font-weight: 850; text-decoration: none; }
  .links-row a:hover { text-decoration: none; background: rgba(29, 79, 145, 0.16); }
</style>
